# Nature assets

- Trees (oak-a, oak-b, ash-a, aspen-a, pine-a): generated with EZ-Tree by Daniel Greenheck
  (MIT licence, https://github.com/dgreenheck/ez-tree), exported to GLB and compressed.
- grass.glb, rock1.glb, flower_yellow.glb, flower_white.glb, and /textures/grass.webp and
  /textures/dirt.webp: from the EZ-Tree project's demo app (same repository, MIT licence).
- /textures/brick.webp: brick texture from the three.js examples (https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js,
  MIT licence), resized.

## Car

`car.glb` is the "Car Concept" sample from the Khronos glTF Sample Assets
(github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Assets), licensed CC BY 4.0, based on a public-domain
model by Unity Fan. Changes: Khronos logo decals removed, textures resized to WebP, mesh simplified
and compressed for the web.
